{%- doc -%}
"Complete your routine" block of the main product (sections/main-product.liquid, block type "complete_routine", placed under the buy buttons):
one extra product shown as a card - photo, name, a short line, price, a checkbox and (when it has several variants) a variant selector.
When the checkbox is ticked, pressing the main "Add to cart" adds this product too: the main product form's submit is held for a moment
(capture phase, before the theme's own product-form handler), this product is added to the cart, and the form is submitted again - so the
cart drawer / cart page that opens already shows both. The dynamic checkout ("Buy it now") button is not affected.

Which product is shown: the last product the visitor viewed (other than this one, loaded in the browser); when there is none, the best seller -
the first available product of the "Best sellers" collection that is not this product (so when this product is the best seller, the next one).
A fixed product can still be set in the block, and then it is always that one.

@param {object} product - the product of the page (the extra product is never the same one)
@param {object} block - the "complete_routine" block
@param {string} product_form_id - the id of the main product form
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  # Which product: a fixed one when the block has one (and it is not this product), otherwise the best seller - the first available product of
  # the "Best sellers" collection (sorted by "Best selling" in the admin; the all-products collection when none is chosen) that is not this
  # product, so when this product is the best seller the next one is taken. In the browser, the last product the visitor viewed (other than
  # this one) then replaces it, when there is one.
  assign extra = nil
  assign is_fixed = false
  assign subtitle = nil

  if block.settings.product != blank and block.settings.product.id != product.id and block.settings.product.available
    assign extra = block.settings.product
    assign is_fixed = true
    assign subtitle = block.settings.subtitle
  else
    assign source_collection = block.settings.fallback_collection | default: collections.all
    for candidate in source_collection.products limit: 20
      if candidate.id != product.id and candidate.available
        assign extra = candidate
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  assign card_id = 'complete-routine-' | append: block.id
-%}

{%- if extra != blank -%}

  <complete-routine class="complete-routine" form="{{ product_form_id }}" id="{{ card_id }}" current-product-id="{{ product.id }}" {% unless is_fixed %}use-recently-viewed{% endunless %} {% if block.settings.checked_by_default %}checked-by-default{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
      <p class="complete-routine__heading h6">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <label class="complete-routine__card" style="background: {{ block.settings.card_background }}; border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;">
      {%- render 'complete-routine-card-content', extra: extra, subtitle: subtitle, checked: block.settings.checked_by_default -%}
    </label>
  </complete-routine>

  <style>
    #{{ card_id }} {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    {%- comment -%}
    Everything inherits the theme's typography, nothing is forced: the heading is a theme heading (.h6: heading font, weight, case and spacing from
    Theme settings > Typography > Headings), and the name, line and price are plain body text (font, weight and case as typed).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__heading {
      margin: 0;
    }

    {%- comment -%}Photo | name, line and price | checkbox on top, variant selector at the bottom{%- endcomment -%}
    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 4.5rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: center;
      column-gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1rem 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: start;
    }

    {%- comment -%}The content wrapper takes no box of its own: photo, text and controls stay the card's three grid columns{%- endcomment -%}
    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__content {
      display: contents;
    }

    {%- comment -%}While the last viewed product is being loaded (a moment), the card is hidden instead of showing the best seller and then switching{%- endcomment -%}
    #{{ card_id }}[loading] .complete-routine__card {
      opacity: 0;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__card {
      transition: opacity .3s ease;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__media img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__info {
      display: grid;
      gap: .25rem;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__price {
      margin-block-start: .25rem;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__controls {
      display: grid;
      align-self: stretch;
      align-content: space-between;
      justify-items: end;
      gap: .75rem;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__checkbox {
      appearance: none;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      margin: 0;
      width: 1.5rem;
      height: 1.5rem;
      color: inherit;
      border: 1.5px solid currentColor;
      border-radius: .375rem;
      background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: grid;
      place-content: center;
      transition: background-color .2s ease;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__checkbox::after {
      content: "";
      width: .45rem;
      height: .8rem;
      border: solid rgb(var(--background, 255 255 255));
      border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;
      transform: translateY(-1px) rotate(45deg) scale(0);
      transition: transform .2s cubic-bezier(.34, 1.56, .64, 1);
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__checkbox:checked {
      background: currentColor;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__checkbox:checked::after {
      transform: translateY(-1px) rotate(45deg) scale(1);
      border-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__checkbox:focus-visible,
    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__select:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid currentColor;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    {%- comment -%}Variant selector: just the text with a line under it and a small arrow, like the reference{%- endcomment -%}
    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__select-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      border-block-end: 1px solid currentColor;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__select {
      appearance: none;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      background: transparent;
      border: 0;
      color: inherit;
      font: inherit;
      padding: 0 1.5rem .25rem 0;
      margin: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      max-width: 9rem;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    #{{ card_id }} .complete-routine__caret {
      position: absolute;
      inset-inline-end: 0;
      top: calc(50% - .25rem - 2px);
      width: .625rem;
      height: .375rem;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    if (!window.customElements.get('complete-routine')) {
      window.customElements.define('complete-routine', class extends HTMLElement {
        connectedCallback() {
          // The price follows the chosen variant (delegated: the card content can be swapped)
          this.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
            var select = event.target.closest && event.target.closest('select[data-complete-routine-variant]');
            if (!select) return;
            var option = select.selectedOptions[0];
            var price = this.querySelector('[data-complete-routine-price]');
            if (option && price) price.textContent = option.getAttribute('data-price');
          });

          this.onSubmit = this.onSubmit.bind(this);
          document.addEventListener('submit', this.onSubmit, true);

          if (this.hasAttribute('use-recently-viewed')) this.loadRecentlyViewed();
        }

        disconnectedCallback() {
          document.removeEventListener('submit', this.onSubmit, true);
        }

        // The last product the visitor viewed, other than this one (the theme keeps the list in localStorage, most recent first)
        recentlyViewedId() {
          var current = Number(this.getAttribute('current-product-id'));
          var list = [];
          try {
            list = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('theme:recently-viewed-products') || '[]');
          } catch (error) {}
          if (!Array.isArray(list)) return null;
          for (var i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {
            if (Number(list[i]) !== current) return Number(list[i]);
          }
          return null;
        }

        async loadRecentlyViewed() {
          var id = this.recentlyViewedId();
          var shown = this.querySelector('[data-product-id]');
          if (!id || (shown && Number(shown.getAttribute('data-product-id')) === id)) return;

          this.setAttribute('loading', '');
          var fallback = setTimeout(() => this.removeAttribute('loading'), 2500);

          try {
            var url = window.Shopify.routes.root + 'search?type=product&q=id:' + id + '&section_id=complete-routine-card';
            var response = await fetch(url, { priority: 'low' });
            var html = new DOMParser().parseFromString(await response.text(), 'text/html');
            var content = html.querySelector('.complete-routine__content');
            var current = this.querySelector('.complete-routine__content');

            if (response.ok && content && current) {
              var checkbox = content.querySelector('[data-complete-routine-checkbox]');
              if (checkbox) checkbox.checked = this.hasAttribute('checked-by-default');
              current.replaceWith(document.importNode(content, true));
            }
          } catch (error) {
            // The best seller rendered by the page stays
          }

          clearTimeout(fallback);
          this.removeAttribute('loading');
        }

        // Ticked: the extra product is added first, then the main form is submitted again (now let through) and runs as usual
        onSubmit(event) {
          var form = event.target;
          var checkbox = this.querySelector('[data-complete-routine-checkbox]');
          var variant = this.querySelector('[data-complete-routine-variant]');

          // getAttribute, not form.id: the product form has a field named "id" (the variant), which form.id returns instead
          if (!form || !form.getAttribute || form.getAttribute('id') !== this.getAttribute('form') || !checkbox || !checkbox.checked || !variant) return;
          if (form.__completeRoutinePass) {
            form.__completeRoutinePass = false;
            return;
          }

          event.preventDefault();
          event.stopImmediatePropagation();

          var submitter = event.submitter;
          if (submitter) submitter.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');

          fetch(window.Shopify.routes.root + 'cart/add.js', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: Number(variant.value), quantity: 1 }] })
          }).catch(function () {}).finally(function () {
            if (submitter) submitter.removeAttribute('aria-busy');
            form.__completeRoutinePass = true;
            if (form.requestSubmit) {
              form.requestSubmit(submitter && submitter.form === form ? submitter : undefined);
            } else {
              form.dispatchEvent(new Event('submit', { cancelable: true, bubbles: true }));
            }
          });
        }
      });
    }
  </script>
{%- endif -%}
